      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The feeling of being obsolete is a very real kind of pain, but it doesn't mean you have no place. Even when everything around you seems to be moving too fast, there is always a possibility for a different kind of stillness for you. Sometimes, the most profound change comes from finding a quiet corner where you can simply be, without the pressure to keep up with the noise. If the weight of this feeling becomes too much, please consider talking to a professional who can help you explore these depths.",
